      <p style="flex: 1 1 380px; margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-ink) 78%, transparent)">Record a few seconds per gesture, then train an LDA and test predictions in your browser.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 44px; background: var(--mg-canvas); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-hairline) 60%, transparent); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden">
      <div style="height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 0 14px; background: var(--mg-raised); border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-black) 50%, transparent)">
        <span aria-hidden="true" style="display: flex; gap: 7px"><span style="width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--mg-home-window-dot)"></span><span style="width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--mg-home-window-dot)"></span><span style="width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--mg-home-window-dot)"></span></span>
        <span style="flex: 1 1 auto; max-width: 520px; height: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 12px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--mg-canvas); font: 400 12px/1 var(--mg-font-mono); color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-ink) 62%, transparent); overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap">nsquaredlab.github.io/MyoGestic/playground</span>
      </div>
      <div style="position: relative; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; padding: 12px; min-height: 460px">
        <div style="flex: 1 1 240px; min-width: 0; max-width: 300px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
          <div style="background: var(--mg-card); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-hairline) 50%, transparent); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px">
            <div style="font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-ink) 60%, transparent)">Recording</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 10px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px; font-size: 12.5px">
              <span style="height: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--mg-home-control)">Rest</span>
              <span style="height: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 6px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-selected-line) 28%, transparent); box-shadow: inset 0 -2px 0 var(--mg-selected-line)">Fist</span>
              <span style="height: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--mg-home-control)">Pinch</span>
              <span style="height: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--mg-home-control)">Index</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="background: var(--mg-card); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-hairline) 50%, transparent); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px">
            <div style="font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-ink) 60%, transparent)">Model</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 10px; height: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 10px; border-radius: 6px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-success) 14%, transparent); font-size: 12.5px">Trained · LDA</div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex: 1 1 auto; background: var(--mg-card); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-hairline) 50%, transparent); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px">
            <div style="font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-ink) 60%, transparent)">Prediction</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--mg-font-display); font-size: 64px; line-height: 1">Fist</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 999 1 360px; min-width: 0; background: var(--mg-card); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-hairline) 50%, transparent); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; min-height: 360px">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 600 320" preserveAspectRatio="none" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block" aria-hidden="true">
            {traces.map((d, index) => <path d={d} style={`stroke: var(--mg-palette-${index})`} fill="none" stroke-width="1.1" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" />)}
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div style="position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-field-bg) 55%, transparent)">
          <a href={`${base}playground/`} style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; height: 56px; padding: 0 28px; background: var(--mg-primary-fill); color: var(--mg-text); border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 4.5v15l13-7.5z"></path></svg>
            Launch the Playground
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin: 14px 0 0; font: 400 12px/1.6 var(--mg-font-mono); color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-ink) 55%, transparent)">Pyodide + imgui-bundle WASM + scikit-learn · about 30 s on first load, cached after</p>
  </div>
</section>
